            "created_at": "2025-07-14T09:33:10.361272+00:00",
            "notes": "The Last perk I take varies one how the match is going. If we're spilt most of the time I won't take Phantasm. If its a super tight map with small rooms I'll take Multiball just for more healing Orbs in the fight. If the other healer has gotten the two dps majority of the time I'll sink my last perk into Precarious Potency just to heal the tank if its a more open map and the Orbs bounce away or get eaten/reflected.\n\nThe last item can be any of the 3 in optional.\n\nBooster Jets for the movespeed after using an ability if you need to play catch up or five heal an ally.\n\nHardlight Accelerator for mostly more Cooldown Reduction but the Weapon Power stacking is a nice add-on for it as well.\n\nMark of the Kitsune for bonus healing after an ability which is great since you'll basically be fading off Cooldown and throwing orbs off Cooldown.",
